  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Southern Sudan Livelihoods Assessment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In partnership with three diocesan Sudanaid (Kosti, Juba and Tombura-Yambio), a consultant will be contracted to lead a livelihoods assessment. The methodology will be adapted to the organisational structure and mandate of each diocesan office. The assessment findings will provide the basis for the development of a Sustainable Livelihoods programme, and will inform CAFOD&#x2019;s Sudan Country Strategy Paper and partner strategic planning processes.</narrative>
  </description>
